@meeting stormLanternBrennan.fixed
// EW2 (events writer 2), the ion storm story A: Brennan at the lantern supper (18:05-18:32, when you're in the mess),
// off duty and there to eat. One of three versions by your Saturday flag: .fixed (storm.lukas.fixed), .asked
// (storm.lukas.asked), .own (storm.lukas.own, or no flag). GUARD RAILS as stormBrennanErrand; nothing about the food
// being late or short.
title: The lantern supper
from: Chef Auda Brennan
gist: Brennan came to the lantern supper to eat, and noticed her range had all six rings.
== lines
brennan: Six rings on a storm night. Somebody's been in my galley with a spanner.   [laugh]
brennan > you: Thank you, love.   [nod]
brennan: Lukas. Good.   [nod]
